# brief desctiption of package "base-files_dni"

Package "base-files_dni" is used to store DNI base-files.
It will cover the same-name file of "package/base-files/files".

NOTE:
  1. Please add DNI changes in "package/base-files/base-files_dni"
  2. Please sync with "package/base-files/files" when upgrade QSDK
